    "createdBy": "FINAL CLOSURE run (Claude Code) applying the DN-01 decision of Bruno (07/10/2026); prices and sources unchanged from otk.cu.reference.v1.2026-10.candidate-1",
    "method": "CU = quantidade normalizada de consumo de serviços de IA. Weights w = p / p_ref from the official Standard list prices frozen for the base period 2026-10. Reference (normalization ruler only): uncached input of gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18, p_ref = US$ 0.15 per 1M tokens. Scale 1/1000: 1 CU = 1 000 reference units. The reference category defines the scale of the unit, not the economic content of the relations between categories; another consistent real reference would change the numbers only by a common factor. A real category was preferred over an abstract US$ 1/MTok price because the latter makes the CU coincide numerically with micro-dollars in the base period.",
    "limitations": [
      "The reference does not imply superiority, quality, industry standard, commercial preference, physical equivalence or eternal stability of the model; it is a frozen ruler.",
      "Basket limited to three small text models (one per provider) in their Standard tier; other models, modalities and tiers are not computable under this profile (no invented weight).",
      "Prices are list prices of the base period; they are not invoices and do not measure energy, FLOPs, quality or capability.",
      "Gemini 3.5 Flash-Lite cache price: the official line does not use the word \"read\" (ambiguity recorded in the entry note)."
    ]
  },
